{"step_index":143,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T06:09:50Z","thinking":"An account creation option needs to be integrated into the authentication screen. The design will involve either a tabbed interface (Sign In / Create Account) or a single-page option with a \"Sign Up\" link. This will provide users with a clear path to create new accounts.\n\n\nA user registration form requires fields for full name, college email, username, password, college/university, engineering branch, semester, and target attendance. Successful account creation should store the account details, set up a student profile, play a victory chime, display a welcome message, and auto-log the user in.\n\nImplement a \"Quick Demo Accounts\" feature on the login screen, with pre-populated credentials for several realistic Indian students, including Aman Sharma from DTU. This facilitates easy demonstration and evaluation of the account creation and login functionality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\student-survival-app\\index.html","EndLine":185,"StartLine":80,"toolAction":"Viewing auth screen in index.html","toolSummary":"Check auth screen structure"}}]}
