{"step_index":151,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T06:10:35Z","thinking":"The existing login form in `index.html` requires an update. Replacing the current single form, the new design will feature a header with a logo, authentication tabs for sign-in and account creation, and a sign-in panel. This panel will include fields for identifier and password (with a demo password hint), a \"Remember Me\" option, submit buttons for different modes, and a grid of one-click demo accounts.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add Create Account tab, full registration form, and Indian student demo logins to Auth screen","EndLine":184,"Instruction":"Upgrade auth screen with Sign In vs Create Account tabs and Indian student demo logins","ReplacementContent":"  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <!-- 🔐 1. LOGIN / CREATE ACCOUNT / DEMO PAGE (Glassmorphism Card) -->\n  <!-- ======================================================== -->\n  <div id=\"auth-screen\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-40 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-6 overflow-y-auto\">\n    <div class=\"w-full max-w-lg glass-card rounded-3xl p-5 sm:p-7 backdrop-blur-2xl shadow-2xl border border-white/20 text-white my-auto animate-fade-in relative overflow-hidden\">\n      <!-- Glow accent behind card -->\n      <div class=\"absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-44 h-44 bg-indigo-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-44 h-44 bg-amber-500/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n      <!-- Header with Logo -->\n      <div class=\"text-center mb-4\">\n        <div class=\"inline-block relative mb-2.5\">\n          <div class=\"w-16 h-16 sm:w-20 sm:h-20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-2 border-indigo-400/50 shadow-xl mx-auto ring-4 ring-indigo-500/20\">\n            <img src=\"assets/life-of-a-student.jpg\" alt=\"Life of a Student Logo\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 text-base\">🧑‍🎓</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black font-heading tracking-tight text-white flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n          🎓 Student Survival App\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-indigo-200 font-medium mt-0.5\">\n          “Survive college. One deadline at a time. 😂”\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Auth Tabs: Sign In vs Create Account -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center p-1 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-white/10 mb-4\">\n        <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.switchAuthTab('signin')\" id=\"tab-auth-signin\" class=\"auth-tab-btn active flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-center transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\">\n          <span>🔑</span> Sign In\n        </button>\n        <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.switchAuthTab('signup')\" id=\"tab-auth-signup\" class=\"auth-tab-btn flex-1 py-2 px-3 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-center transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5\">\n          <span>➕</span> Create Account\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ================= 1. SIGN IN TAB ================= -->\n      <div id=\"auth-panel-signin\" class=\"space-y-4\">\n        <form id=\"login-form\" onsubmit=\"App.handleLogin(event)\" class=\"space-y-3\">\n          <div>\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1\">👤 Username or College Email</label>\n            <div class=\"relative\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"login-identifier\" placeholder=\"e.g. aman_sharma or aman.sharma@college.edu\" required\n                class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent transition\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1 flex justify-between\">\n              <span>🔒 Password</span>\n              <span class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-300 font-normal\">Demo pass: password123 🔑</span>\n            </label>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"login-password\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" required\n              class=\"w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-transparent transition\">\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-300 pt-0.5\">\n            <label class=\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none\">\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"login-remember\" checked class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded text-indigo-600 focus:ring-indigo-500 bg-slate-800 border-white/20\">\n              <span>☑ Remember me</span>\n            </label>\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.openDemoCredentialsModal()\" class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-300 hover:text-amber-200 underline font-bold\">\n              View Demo Passwords 📋\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Submit Buttons -->\n          <div class=\"pt-2 space-y-2\">\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full py-2.5 sm:py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-indigo-500 to-indigo-700 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-indigo-600 text-white font-extrabold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/40 hover:shadow-indigo-600/60 active:scale-[0.98] transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n              <span>🚀 Enter Survival Mode</span>\n            </button>\n\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.loginAsGuest()\" class=\"w-full py-2 px-4 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/15 text-slate-200 hover:text-white font-bold text-xs border border-white/15 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n              <span>🎒 Continue as Guest</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </form>\n\n        <!-- QUICK 1-CLICK DEMO ACCOUNTS (INDIAN STUDENTS) -->\n        <div class=\"mt-4 pt-3.5 border-t border-white/10\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\">\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-300 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n              <span>⚡</span> Quick Demo Login (Indian Students):\n            </span>\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.openDemoCredentialsModal()\" class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 hover:text-white underline\">\n              All 5 accounts &rarr;\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-left\" id=\"demo-accounts-grid\">\n            <!-- 1. Aman Sharma -->\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.quickDemoLogin('aman_sharma')\" class=\"demo-account-pill p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-indigo-600/20 border border-white/10 text-left transition flex items-center gap-2.5 group\">\n              <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/30 border border-indigo-400/40 text-indigo-300 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-indigo-600 group-hover:text-white\">\n                AS\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Aman Sharma</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 truncate\">DTU CSE • Sem 4 (80% 🟢)</div>\n              </div>\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- 2. Priya Patel -->\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.quickDemoLogin('priya_patel')\" class=\"demo-account-pill p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-rose-600/20 border border-white/10 text-left transition flex items-center gap-2.5 group\">\n              <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-rose-500/30 border border-rose-400/40 text-rose-300 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-rose-600 group-hover:text-white\">\n                PP\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Priya Patel</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 truncate\">NIT Trichy IT • Sem 4 (88% 🟢)</div>\n              </div>\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- 3. Rahul Verma -->\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.quickDemoLogin('rahul_v')\" class=\"demo-account-pill p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-rose-600/20 border border-rose-500/30 text-left transition flex items-center gap-2.5 group\">\n              <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/30 border border-amber-400/40 text-amber-300 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-amber-600 group-hover:text-white\">\n                RV\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Rahul Verma ⚠️</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-rose-400 font-semibold truncate\">VIT ECE • Shortage! (65% 🔴)</div>\n              </div>\n            </button>\n\n            <!-- 4. Ananya Iyer -->\n            <button type=\"button\" onclick=\"App.quickDemoLogin('ananya_iyer')\" class=\"demo-account-pill p-2 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-emerald-600/20 border border-white/10 text-left transition flex items-center gap-2.5 group\">\n              <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/30 border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-300 font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 group-hover:bg-emerald-600 group-hover:text-white\">\n                AI\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs font-bold text-white truncate\">Ananya Iyer</div>\n                <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 truncate\">BITS Pilani AI • Sem 6 (92% ⭐)</div>\n              </div>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ================= 2. CREATE ACCOUNT TAB ================= -->\n      <div id=\"auth-panel-signup\" class=\"hidden space-y-3.5\">\n        <form id=\"signup-form\" onsubmit=\"App.handleSignUp(event)\" class=\"space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5\">\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1\">👤 Full Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"signup-name\" placeholder=\"e.g. Rohan Gupta\" required\n                class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-xs font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1\">🔑 Username</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"signup-username\" placeholder=\"e.g. rohan_coder\" required\n                class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-xs font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <label class=\"block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 mb-1\">📧 College Email</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"signup-email\" placeholder=\"e.g. rohan.gupta@iitd.ac.in\" required\n              class=\"w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/70 border border-white/20 text-xs font-semibold text-white placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500\">\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:g